Buffer::get_local_ipc_handle
来源: csrc/deep_ep.cpp
--------------------------------

【签名】
    get_local_ipc_handle() -> bytearray

【算法】
    assert this.num_nvl_bytes > 0
    
    shared_memory_allocator.get_mem_handle(&ipc_handles[rank], buffer_ptrs[rank])
    
    return bytearray((char*)&ipc_handles[rank], HANDLE_SIZE)

